{
  "id": "resolving-misunderstanding",
  "title": "澄清朋友間的誤會",
  "titleEn": "Resolving a Misunderstanding",
  "category": "同儕關係",
  "level": "中級",
  "image": {
    "src": "/images/scenes/resolving-misunderstanding.webp",
    "alt": "放學後的校園林蔭步道旁，兩位國中生並肩坐在木質長椅上認真交談，一人拿著手機溫和解釋簡訊的真意，另一人專注傾聽並展現理解的笑容，氣氛溫馨釋懷。",
    "width": 1536,
    "height": 1024
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "After school, Leo sits on a wooden bench to talk openly with his "
        },
        {
          "text": "friend",
          "wordIds": [
            "friend"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ethan."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "放學後，Leo 坐在木長椅上，與他的朋友 Ethan 坦誠地交談。"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "They had an awkward "
        },
        {
          "text": "misunderstanding",
          "wordIds": [
            "misunderstanding"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " because of a confusing text "
        },
        {
          "text": "message",
          "wordIds": [
            "message"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " sent yesterday."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "因為昨天發送的一則令人困惑的簡訊，他們之間產生了尷尬的誤會。"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Leo shows his phone and explains that he did not "
        },
        {
          "text": "mean",
          "wordIds": [
            "mean"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " to sound rude, saying, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "That's not what I ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "thats-not-what-i-meant"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "meant",
          "phraseIds": [
            "thats-not-what-i-meant"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "mean"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "phraseIds": [
            "thats-not-what-i-meant"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Leo 拿出手機並解釋自己並沒有想要表現得很無禮，說道：「那不是我的意思。」"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "He looks at Ethan sincerely and adds, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "I am ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "i-am-sorry-about-that"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "sorry",
          "phraseIds": [
            "i-am-sorry-about-that"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "sorry"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " about that.",
          "phraseIds": [
            "i-am-sorry-about-that"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "他真誠地看著 Ethan 並補充說：「我對那件事感到很抱歉。」"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Ethan takes a deep breath and is willing to "
        },
        {
          "text": "listen",
          "wordIds": [
            "listen"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " carefully to his explanation."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Ethan 深吸了一口氣，願意仔細聆聽他的解釋。"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Understanding the whole situation, Ethan smiles and says, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "Thanks for explaining.",
          "phraseIds": [
            "thanks-for-explaining"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "理解了整個情況後，Ethan 微笑著說：「謝謝你的說明。」"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "They bump fists happily on the bench, and Leo says, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "We are still ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "we-are-still-friends"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "friends",
          "phraseIds": [
            "we-are-still-friends"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "friend"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "phraseIds": [
            "we-are-still-friends"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "他們在長椅上開心地碰拳，Leo 說道：「我們依然是朋友。」"
    }
  ],
